# Agent workflow

Follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for this repository.

## Tests before commit

Before every code commit:

1. Run `make test-docker` (or `make test`).
2. Commit only when the suite is green.
3. On failure: fix tests/code first, re-run, then commit. Never commit a red suite.

## Feature tracking

On every feature request:

1. Create `feature/gw-<N>.md` with the next free number (after existing `feature/gw-*.md`).
2. Use Problem / Impact / Shorthand solution / Related code sections.
3. Stage and commit that file with the feature changes — never land feature code without it.

If implementing an existing `feature/gw-*.md`, update that file in the same commit instead of creating a duplicate.
